WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.103
"Why are you here?" asked Zippy.

2
00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:13.408
"This is a racetrack.

3
00:00:13.409 --> 00:00:23.722
It's for speedy cars!"

4
00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.809
"I'm going to practice," said Eddy.

5
00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.209
"Practice what?" asked Zippy.

6
00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.060
"Racing," said Eddy.

7
00:00:34.061 --> 00:00:36.782
Zippy laughed.

8
00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:38.724
"I'm fast!

9
00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:42.632
I don't need to practice!"

10
00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:47.671
Eddy sighed.

11
00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:53.228
Then he zoomed down the track.

12
00:00:53.229 --> 00:00:56.499
"Let's race!" said Zippy.

13
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.608
"I'm going to win!"

14
00:00:58.609 --> 00:01:15.885
Zippy shot after Eddy.

15
00:01:15.886 --> 00:01:18.805
The sky grew dark.

16
00:01:18.806 --> 00:01:23.962
Raindrops splashed everywhere.

17
00:01:23.963 --> 00:01:27.296
Eddy's tires slipped in a puddle.

18
00:01:27.297 --> 00:01:30.058
Eddy slowed down.

19
00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:32.731
But Zippy went faster.

20
00:01:32.732 --> 00:01:44.257
Water sprayed off Zippy's tires.

21
00:01:44.258 --> 00:01:49.420
"Hey, Zippy!" Eddy yelled.

22
00:01:49.421 --> 00:01:55.612
"You need to slow—" Crack!

23
00:01:55.613 --> 00:01:58.300
Lightning struck a big tree.

24
00:01:58.301 --> 00:02:02.262
The tree fell onto the racetrack.

25
00:02:02.263 --> 00:02:09.045
"Slow down, Zippy!" cried Eddy.

26
00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:16.654
"You're going to crash!"

